.019,0.002,0.001,0.001,0.0,0.0],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"\"I prefer to call it not being a fool. This copy is perfectly legal. Unlike your map, which the librarians now know you stole.\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.576,"end":9.888,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":24,"words":24},"large":{"start":0.576,"end":9.86,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":24,"words":24},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"At this, a gang of the fiercest city librarians emerge from the building armed with hardback copies of The Art of War . They're going to make you pay for stealing that map, and probably your $63.50 in unpaid late fees too.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":10.368,"end":26.112,"frac":0.952,"status":"ok","matched":40,"words":42},"large":{"start":10.368,"end":26.112,"frac":0.952,"status":"ok","matched":40,"words":42},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"Time is of the essence, you’ll have to collect your supplies and round up the fiercest crew before Captain Neckbeard gets to them or the librarians catch you. You won’t have time to get them all – you’ll need to pick and choose what you think will aid you the most.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":26.592,"end":39.712,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":50,"words":50},"large":{"start":26.592,"end":39.712,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":50,"words":50},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"Time to escape! Check your list and make your choice!","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":40.608,"end":44.0,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":10,"words":10},"large":{"start":40.608,"end":44.0,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":10,"words":10},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"The local pub, where you'll be able to hide from the librarians and begin your search for supplies?","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":44.576,"end":49.9,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":18,"words":18},"large":{"start":44.576,"end":49.64,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":18,"words":18},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"Or","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":49.9,"end":50.4,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":1,"words":1},"large":{"start":49.64,"end":50.4,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":1,"words":1},"differ":false},{"i":6,"text":"The lair of the Kraken, who might protect you from irate, book wielding archivists and point you in the direction of crew?","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":51.072,"end":57.632,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":22,"words":22},"large":{"start":51.072,"end":57.632,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":22,"words":22},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68fa5b7387022_checklist_blank.png"}